sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant C as Chat service
  participant O as Orchestrator
  participant A as Agent runtime
  participant M as Claude API
  U->>C: kirim prompt
  C->>O: prompt + session_id
  O->>A: query(prompt, resume)
  A->>M: konteks + cache
  M-->>A: stream token
  A-->>O: StreamEvent text_delta
  O-->>C: SSE / WebSocket
  C-->>U: token tampil live
  A-->>O: ResultMessage
  O->>C: simpan transkrip
